      "title": "实时计划",
      "order": 0,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-24T09:49:33.834Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-24T09:50:26.078Z",
      "contentHtml": "<pre style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Consolas; font-size: 12pt;\">003<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">把记事本开发完善<br></span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">设置和弹出窗口标题样式问题<br></span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">浏览器三个点增加一个智能体约定关键词</span>,<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">把公约中与智能体的约定显示出来</span>,<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">说明是干啥的</span>,<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">可复制那个关键词<br></span>003<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">定时调度<br></span>--001<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">浏览器提示窗口不在那里放</span>,<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">回填密码也是</span>,<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">不在那里变更浏览器大小<br></span>--<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">设置里把实时字体字号放出<br></span>--<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">有个解决</span>IDEA<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">杀进程的</span>TOMCAT<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">没关的插件<br></span>--<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">悬浮球显示问题<br></span>--003GIT<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">收藏同步直接改了</span>,<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">收藏配置放设置里</span>,<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">只要设置配了直接自动同步</span>,<span style=\"font-family:'Arial';\">记事本的东西也从里面读</span></pre><p></p>"
    },
